OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers gradually
OL,6,Ffading leaving a largely dry and
OL,7,Fbright day across the UK, with the
OL,8,Fsunniest skies in Scotland. Breezy
OL,9,Falong North Sea coasts but tending to
OL,10,Fease later. Temperatures near or
OL,11,Fperhaps a little below average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA largely dry and clear
OL,14,Fnight, but cloud and rain will reach
OL,15,Fthe far west later on in the night.
OL,16,FFeeling chilly, especially in the
OL,17,Fcountryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
