OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloud and rain will spread
OL,6,Ferratically eastwards throughout the
OL,7,Fday. Rain turning heavier at times,
OL,8,Fparticularly in the north, with the
OL,9,Fsoutheast likely remaining dry until
OL,10,Fafter dark.
